  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760372",
      "title": "Module Introduction & A Challenge For You!",
      "sourceHash": "4658f3270013313470689bdf3b93b0205279d5b2d7c293b67c1a9f3b9252a0e9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "This course section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 7.32,
          "en": "is all about practicing those important React essentials",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.32,
          "end": 11.01,
          "en": "we covered throughout the previous course sections.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.01,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "And to practice those essentials, in this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 19.86,
          "en": "we'll explore yet another brand new demo project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 22.98,
          "en": "Our React-powered Investment Calculator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "which the website visitors can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 28.83,
          "en": "to calculate the future value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.83,
          "end": 32.46,
          "en": "or actually multiple future values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.46,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "for given investment parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "And whilst we, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 41.25,
          "en": "already did build various demo projects up to this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.25,
          "end": 43.2,
          "en": "this demo project here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.2,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "is all about you practicing what you learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "because in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 52.32,
          "en": "we're not going to dive into new concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.32,
          "end": 54.48,
          "en": "or new React features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.48,
          "end": 56.16,
          "en": "Instead, we're going to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.16,
          "end": 58.71,
          "en": "this Investment Calculator web app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 62.19,
          "en": "so that you can practice working with components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.19,
          "end": 64.17,
          "en": "or with state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.17,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "and that you can practice outputting list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 69.03,
          "en": "and conditional content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "Because my task for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 75.603,
          "en": "is that you try building this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 80.03999999999999,
          "en": "And to help you with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.03999999999999,
          "end": 82.62,
          "en": "I created a starting project to which you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.62,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "of course, find attached both a local version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "and a CodeSandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "For the local version, as always, if you want to use that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 94.28999999999999,
          "en": "you have to download and extract it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.28999999999999,
          "end": 96.3,
          "en": "and then run npm install.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 99.78,
          "en": "And once you did that, you have to run npm run dev",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 101.94,
          "en": "to spin up that development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.94,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "This is not needed on CodeSandbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.78999999999999,
          "end": 106.74000000000001,
          "en": "But with that up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.74000000000001,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "with that starting project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 112.02000000000001,
          "en": "your goal is to add components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.02000000000001,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "and state and all the things that might be needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "to build this Investment Calculator web app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.02,
          "en": "Now, to make this process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.02,
          "end": 123.42,
          "en": "of building this web app a bit easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.42,
          "end": 126.78,
          "en": "and to allow you to focus on the React features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.78,
          "end": 128.07,
          "en": "you learned about,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 131.31,
          "en": "in this starting project, in the src folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.31,
          "end": 133.44,
          "en": "you'll find an index.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.44,
          "end": 137.07,
          "en": "which already includes a bunch of CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.07,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "so that you don't have to write any custom CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "to build this web app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 145.14,
          "en": "And if you take a look at this CSS code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.14,
          "end": 148.35,
          "en": "in there, you also might find some hints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.35,
          "end": 151.98,
          "en": "on how you could structure your web application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.98,
          "end": 154.38,
          "en": "regarding some components you could build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 156.93,
          "en": "Maybe for example, a user input component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.93,
          "end": 160.62,
          "en": "that groups these user input fields together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.62,
          "end": 162.32999999999998,
          "en": "Though, of course, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.32999999999998,
          "end": 165.12,
          "en": "it's totally up to you how you build this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 165.12,
          "end": 168.9,
          "en": "because there also won't be a single correct solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.9,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "Instead, there will be multiple possible solutions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 174.84,
          "en": "This section is really just about you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 178.323,
          "en": "trying out what you learned and practicing what you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.37,
          "end": 181.47,
          "en": "But besides this CSS code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.47,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "you'll also find a util folder in that src folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 189.75,
          "en": "besides the assets folder with an image you can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.75,
          "end": 194.75,
          "en": "And in that util folder here, you find an investment.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.24,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "which includes a calculateInvestmentResults function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 203.43,
          "en": "which you can use to derive these results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 208.11,
          "en": "that are shown in this table, in this finished app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "And I'm providing this function to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "so that you don't have to come up with the logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.46,
          "end": 215.49,
          "en": "for calculating those investment values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.49,
          "end": 219.213,
          "en": "but that you instead can focus on the React concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.2,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "And you'll also find a formatter object in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 224.43,
          "en": "which is being exported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.43,
          "end": 228.18,
          "en": "and which therefore can be imported in other files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.18,
          "end": 232.47,
          "en": "Just as this calculate investment results function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "And this formatter object is simply a utility object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 239.16,
          "en": "that you can use to format numbers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.16,
          "end": 242.46,
          "en": "to look pretty and to look like currency,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.46,
          "end": 246.423,
          "en": "just as you see it in that final result I showed you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.62,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "And with that, you got a goal, you got a starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 252.42,
          "en": "you got some helper files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.42,
          "end": 254.7,
          "en": "And now my challenge for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.7,
          "end": 258.9,
          "en": "is that you try building this Investment Calculator web app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "that you use the React concepts you learn about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 265.29,
          "en": "And that you of course, don't get discouraged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.29,
          "end": 267.3,
          "en": "if this takes you some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.3,
          "end": 270,
          "en": "Because after all, this is the first practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270,
          "end": 272.28,
          "en": "where you should work totally on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.28,
          "end": 274.35,
          "en": "And therefore, it's totally fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 274.35,
          "end": 276.18,
          "en": "if this takes you a bit longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.18,
          "end": 279,
          "en": "or also if you are not able to build this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279,
          "end": 282.18,
          "en": "Because that's of course the idea behind practice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 282.18,
          "end": 285.51,
          "en": "failing, learning, and becoming better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 288.65999999999997,
          "en": "And therefore, starting in the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 288.65999999999997,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "I'll build this web app together with you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "I'll walk you through my solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 293.85,
          "end": 296.43,
          "en": "Though I, of course, also want to emphasize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 296.43,
          "end": 299.85,
          "en": "that my solution is just one possible solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 299.85,
          "end": 302.52,
          "en": "and definitely not the only solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 302.52,
          "end": 305.34,
          "en": "So definitely give this a try on your own first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 305.34,
          "end": 307.743,
          "en": "before you then take a look at my solution.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}